  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Suppose that $\\phi$ is an automorphism of a finite soluble group $G$. Must $G$ contain a subgroup of index bounded in terms of $|\\phi|$ and $|C_G(\\phi)|$ whose Fitting height is bounded\n\n(a) in terms of $|\\phi|$?\n\n(b) or even in terms of the composition length of $\\langle\\phi\\rangle$?",
